{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Base"}], "prev": {"link": "../geo-point-address/", "title": "GeoPointAddress"}, "next": {"link": "../group-call/", "title": "GroupCall"}, "title": "GlobalPrivacySettings", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"globalprivacysettings\">\n<h1>GlobalPrivacySettings<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#globalprivacysettings\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.base.GlobalPrivacySettings\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">GlobalPrivacySettings</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.base.GlobalPrivacySettings\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API base type.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Constructors:</dt><dd><p>This base type has 1 constructor available.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/global-privacy-settings/#pyrogram.raw.types.GlobalPrivacySettings\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.GlobalPrivacySettings\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GlobalPrivacySettings</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</dd>\n<dt>Functions:</dt><dd><p>This object can be returned by 2 functions.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../functions/account/get-global-privacy-settings/#pyrogram.raw.functions.account.GetGlobalPrivacySettings\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.f